---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
	title="About Me"
	description="A little more about the person behind the projects."
	eyebrow="About"
>
	<section class="content-shell py-12 space-y-16">

		<!-- Big Introduction -->
		<div>
		<h2 class="m-0 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink">
			About Me
		</h2>
		</div>

		<!-- Smaller Sections -->
		<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-12">

			<!-- Apart from Tech -->
			<div class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
					Apart from Tech
				</h2>

				<p class="m-0 text-muted leading-relaxed">
					Outside of technology, I enjoy spending time on things that
					let me step away from the screen. I like music, football,
					participating in college events, and trying out things that
					are completely unrelated to what I normally work on.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Music -->
			<div class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
					Music
				</h2>

				<p class="m-0 text-muted leading-relaxed">
					I play the Tabla and have performed at college events,
					including Savishkaara. Music has been one of the things
					I’ve enjoyed alongside academics and technology.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Hobbies -->
			<div class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
					Hobbies
				</h2>

				<p class="m-0 text-muted leading-relaxed">
					I’m a big football fan and support Manchester United.
					I also enjoy discovering new music, experimenting with
					random ideas, and occasionally starting a project at
					2 AM because it seemed like a good idea at the time.
				</p>
			</div>

		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>